{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56244","headline":"判小朝官郭延钧进识字女子 · 宋光嗣","name":"判小朝官郭延钧进识字女子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"进来便是宫人，状内犹言女子。\n应见容止可观，遂令始制文字。\n更遣阿母教招，恨不太真相似。\n且图亲近官家，直向内廷求事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋光嗣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}